<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-29T21:54:51.288Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:54:51 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have struck Yemen's Aden airport and launched a ballistic missile toward Saudi Arabia's Ras Tanura refinery, while Saudi-led coalition aircraft bombed a market in northern Yemen and a petrol station, causing civilian casualties. Saudi civil defense intercepted a Houthi missile over the Eastern Province and the coalition reported destroying additional missiles targeting Riyadh. Aden airport has reopened after the Houthi attack, and a Saudi strike killed 12 people in a residential area in Yemen. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168673&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPQ2FrR3hGTjlic3RtRHdHQWtvbjJ5cXNPNFExeWlSMGRpOFpIOFk1WFBUX3VoUEs5MWhkMXVIcFlmc3BaMkE0NnlWbXdacUNZRXg0emVrUjhJTENacVRqY2M5aGpvY08wQmhVYWJxbkdOZlB6dzUwZGNLY3ZkUGFQOVJZekxCM19qdVAtajNOdmdrU2JIc0M5QXZuN1M?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxNRE5GdUd5OWVlSXlJcU5fbkt4ZjZVbDBsRV8yYm1zSFBCNDRvSTJISzlXaU9xeTNxcC1kMzc1SlNneXRkaUJLQ1E5VUctYkstQXM3R3RHeld4Q0daS0N2MVc5VVBramhRMFoxVlk0WTNobEZyX0FkcUR6SmtQSlN1Rm5UamM2Y3ZzN3c?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Saudi Gazette&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBKam50SjZ2NE9VcnNsN0JT